    [4907]={name="Woodland Tunic",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Webwood Egg' - pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="Webwood Egg",lore="Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."},
    [4908]={name="Nomadic Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Continues' - pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Continues",lore="A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."},
    [4914]={name="Battleworn Leather Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cutting Teeth' - pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4921]={name="Dust-covered Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion' - pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4925]={name="Primitive Hand Blade",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Vile Familiars' - pick it over the other choices.",questName="Vile Familiars",lore="I was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here... A group that calls itself the Burning Blade has a coven here in the Valley of Trials."},
    [4928]={name="Sandrunner Wristguards",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....' - pick it over the other choices. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4947]={name="Jagged Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Skull Rock' - pick it over the other choices. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="Skull Rock",lore=". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."},
    [4951]={name="Squealer's Belt",quality=1,ilvl=7,reqLevel=1,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from \"Squealer\" Thornmantle in Kalimdor.",zone="Kalimdor",npc="\"Squealer\" Thornmantle"},
    [4954]={name="Nomadic Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Begins' - pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4962]={name="Double-layered Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Leather' - pick it over the other choices. In Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
